  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "環境變遷與永續發展",
    "sub_ename": "ENVIRONMENT CHANGE AND SUSTAINABLE DEVELOPMENT",
    "describe_ch": "使學生了解環境倫理思想對環境的影響，透過各種環境議題的討論，建立整體生態共存的全球觀和價值信念，進而創造出對環境關懷的永續發展行為已啟發環保意識。",
    "describe_eh": "The purpose of this course is to help the student to understand the influence of environmental ethics on the environment. The following environmental consciousness that could be inspired the establishment of a global view of the overall ecological coexistence and value beliefs, and thus create a sustainable development of environmental care behavior inspire environmental awareness.",
